==Battleground==
*10 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 8.33 seconds<sup>250f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 8~20 seconds<sup>240f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 8~20 seconds<sup>240f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns.
**4 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns.
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns.
**4 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns.
**5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Big Sal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This is a very simple stage, as it's just a remake of Underground without any huge changes. The main differences are the appearance of Big Sal and the removal of Angel peons and Shadow Boxer Ks. [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] destroy the stage with their [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-control]], stackable DPS, [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|wave block]] / tanking, and burst damage respectively. Bring [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]] to prevent the Owlbrows from stacking, [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight Cat]] to push Big Sal back, and some 75¢ [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] as Octopus Cat can't stall alone.

If one has [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Meditation cat]], he can protect your base from Big Sal indefinitely, just make sure he doesn't accidentally die to Pigeon's wave attacks.

